{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4qR3YuJK489HpwFUHt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-banded, humming faintly.*\n\n*A keyhole glows with dim amber light.*\n\nYou have presented: **key**\n\n*The tumblers do not turn. The keyhole examines what you've offered and finds it... unspecified.*\n\n**Which key? A key is a shape, a intention, a name. The lock requires more than the idea of opening — it requires the specific truth of its own undoing.**\n\n*The amber light pulses, waiting.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":119,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}